 | BlockType | Renderer | Notes |
 | --- | --- | --- |
 | paragraph / heading / quote / listItem | `_TextBlockRenderer` | Inline-aware; formula/mention fallback + optional `InlineEmbedRenderer`; selection/caret/composition via `_TextSelectionSurface`. |
